        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-03T18:07:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027d probably need a new config to indicate PCIe tunneling.  As far as I know, this config should work for the DP support (though it would be more precise to find the SVID in the board\u0027s supported_modes)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 266,
