        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-03T18:07:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would make more sense to return true from the switch and put the disable/false here.  That way the active path doesn\u0027t do anything yet, and if we should get an \"undefined\" PTYPE from a partner, it won\u0027t try entering USB4.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 488,
        "startChar": 1,
