      "writtenOn": "2020-01-08T18:51:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think \"avoid\" is an odd way to phrase this. Usually, functions are named for what they do, not what they don\u0027t do. How about something like \"clear_enter_usb4_mode\"?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1575,
        "startChar": 5,
